title ALES71 — Lotus's chorus, a triangle-LFO modulated delay round a centre
prompt recur the itinerary Lindy-first crux-first, take the next agent-doable lap, approve own design rounds, send each finished increment, stop at custody gates
think ALES70's own recommendation named the next crux plainly: the periodic modulated delay that yields the chorus, a thin rung on the proven fractional interpolation. Lindy-first the interpolation is already the durable primitive; crux-first the one decisive new move is a clean triangle LFO with EXACT anchors, so the modulation is testable directly rather than trusted.
think Kept the ALES70 interpolation read verbatim and changed only the driver — instead of the one-way ramp scaled_delay_at, a symmetric triangle triangle_delay_at(centre, depth, period, k) round the centre. Period a positive multiple of four so its quarter q = period/4 is whole and the four anchors land exactly: centre at k≡0 and k≡2q, +depth at q, −depth at 3q. Honestly @divTrunc-quantized between, exactly as ALES70's ramp is.
think The strongest reuse anchor: a ZERO-DEPTH chorus is exactly ALES70's glide(centre, centre) byte-for-byte — the periodic driver reduces to the one-way one when it does not move. That case is proven against the real glide (both tools run), which glide's own witness already binds to ALES68's one-tap multitap, so the whole delay lineage stays consistent.
think Chose period = 4 (q = 1), centre = 2·scale, depth = 1·scale for the hand-computed law: the triangle lands the delay on WHOLE samples at every offset (delays 2,3,2,1,2,3), so each read is an exact integer tap and the six output samples are computable by hand on sig[i] = i·1000.
obs GREEN on the first build across all six laws — no RED. New faults over glide: BadPeriod (not a positive multiple of four, or past max_clip), BadDepth (a swing whose bottom centre−depth dips below one whole sample), keeping BadDelay for a swing top past max_clip. Each refuses before any write, the clip untouched, proven.
obs TAME style bans clean, width clean, ALES70 glide stays GREEN beside the chorus. The design read was self-approved (no custody gate — bounded in-process i16 PCM, no network/keys/funds/device/sample-rate).
loom witness=ales_chorus_witness laws=6 green=1 reruns=ales70_glide glide_scale=256 period_law=multiple_of_4 max_clip=4096
